    "text": {
      "fields": [
        {
          "id": "text-promise-main",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 0,
          "focusWU": 0.161,
          "endWU": 0.32165,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "opener"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "opener-v1",
          "text": "I help shape complex ideas into emotionally compelling experiences."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-idea",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 1.7,
          "focusWU": 2.1,
          "endWU": 2.525,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "Ambition is rarely the hard part."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-conditions",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 2.55,
          "focusWU": 2.975,
          "endWU": 3.4,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "The hard part is giving them form people can understand, trust and use."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-direction",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 3.425,
          "focusWU": 3.85,
          "endWU": 4.19,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "center"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "That is the territory I have built my career around."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-title",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 5.2,
          "focusWU": 5.375,
          "endWU": 5.55,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-title",
            "kind": "highlight",
            "text": "I studied Communication Design because I wanted to understand how meaning is made.",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "text": "Communication Design",
                "tone": "blue"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-fragmented",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 5.55,
          "focusWU": 5.725,
          "endWU": 5.9,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-fragmented",
            "kind": "prose",
            "text": "In words, images, systems, motion and the gaps between them."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-practice",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 5.9,
          "focusWU": 6.075,
          "endWU": 6.25,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-practice",
            "kind": "prose",
            "text": "Agency work gave me a grounding in visual culture and craft.",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "text": "visual culture and craft",
                "tone": "blue"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-curiosity",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 6.25,
          "focusWU": 6.425,
          "endWU": 6.6,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-curiosity",
            "kind": "prose",
            "text": "Product work moved the questions closer to behaviour: how a service explains itself, how a screen earns trust, how a system holds together under pressure.",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "text": "behaviour",
                "tone": "green"
              },
              {
                "text": "trust",
                "tone": "blue"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-technology",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 6.6,
          "focusWU": 6.775,
          "endWU": 6.95,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-technology",
            "kind": "prose",
            "text": "This is why emerging technology keeps my attention. New tools become useful only when they are translated into something people can see, try and understand.",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "text": "emerging technology",
                "tone": "orange"
              },
              {
                "text": "see, try and understand",
                "tone": "blue"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-context",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 6.95,
          "focusWU": 7.125,
          "endWU": 7.3,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-context",
            "kind": "prose",
            "text": "My experience has taken me through startups and creative agencies, across digital products, web design, identity, interfaces, motion and creative technology, with projects in finance, mobility, healthcare, identity and product innovation.",
            "emphasis": [
              {
                "text": "startups",
                "tone": "orange"
              },
              {
                "text": "creative agencies",
                "tone": "blue"
              },
              {
                "text": "product innovation",
                "tone": "green"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-background-clients",
          "kind": "scroll-block",
          "startWU": 7.3,
          "focusWU": 7.475,
          "endWU": 7.65,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "reading"
          },
          "block": {
            "id": "background-clients",
            "kind": "clients",
            "items": [
              "Yoti",
              "S&P Global",
              "Bentley",
              "SunExpress",
              "McCann",
              "American Heart Association"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-curiosity",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 8.095,
          "focusWU": 8.329,
          "endWU": 8.6044,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "constellation"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "I am not interested in disciplines as departments."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-listen",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 8.5496,
          "focusWU": 8.825,
          "endWU": 9.1004,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "constellation"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "I am interested in what they make possible together."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-complexity-focus",
          "kind": "title",
          "startWU": 9.0206,
          "focusWU": 9.296,
          "endWU": 9.602,
          "publishable": true,
          "presentation": {
            "layout": "constellation"
          },
          "movement": "spatial",
          "preset": "travelling-title-v1",
          "text": "Together, they become a way to make the idea tangible."
        },
        {
          "id": "text-practice-disciplines",
